OL,3,GNEWSATown crier of 40 years dies after
OL,4,Aroyal honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeeks told the BBC previously: "I first
OL,7,Fwent out with the town crier when I was
OL,8,Feight years old, in the Cotswolds where
OL,9,FI grew up. I always wanted to be a town
OL,10,Fcrier."
